    "description": "From transforming nursing education at AKU to pioneering research that improves the lives of people with chronic diseases, Dr Ladak's impact is profound. As the Gulshan Bhatia Endowed Associate Professor and Assistant Dean of Graduate Programmes at the Aga Khan University, she has mentored countless students-empowering the next generation of healthcare leaders.",
